reconstructed fixtures/server-log/v8_1/webservice/garbage_frames.* (the helper protocol, research D-4: an unknown progress frame between node ok and part log ok).
Frames as in the 8.1 case in the REST_90 variant: start REST_90 instead of start SOAP_81, without the two log4j lines of the 8.1 SOAP client, with the REST client's netty line after start taken over from the recorded fixtures/queue-entry/v9_0/not_found_file.frames (9.0.10). garbage_frames.log is the acme_StockService request entry of ok.log; its fictitious log is the 8.1 one with the times moved (09:14 -> 10:21), so its size and the byte count of part log ok stay. Synthetic frames.
